{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026CbUcH3j36d1794732262.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>黃大仙下邨有單位起火，消防發現一具屍體，相信是獨居戶主，又指屋內滿布雜物。期間約300人要疏散。</p><p></p><p>大火救熄後，消防繼續在涉事單位內射水降溫。警方稱早上8時許接報，黃大仙下邨龍光樓，一個低層單位發生火警，約300人要疏散，消防事後在起火單位客廳，發現一具屍體，相信是80歲獨居女戶主。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.FIRE.WTS-1700.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20261NjbgIAdfU1794734114.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>消防處高級消防隊長陳振維說：「在起火單位內，我們發現大量雜物，消防處初步調查相信，火警並無可疑，我們會循煙頭或者香燭冥鏹意外燃燒雜物的方向，跟其他相關部門進行調查。住所裡面其實有很多雜物，由約1.2米堆至天花板的高度，我們見到有尼龍袋，亦有不同的膠袋、膠樽之類。」</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.FIRE.WTS-1700_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026OSJBd2VXne1794734134.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>他又稱另一單位一名65歲女住戶逃生時吸入濃煙不適、清醒送院。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T09:58:47.260081+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":305,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T08:37:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T13:11:38.182980+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T09:52:34.883492+00:00","content_hash":"68ccea96ba43e5767d82b7a0638561f57318cefe00cd204307206654c30ff119","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-15T09:58:47.260081+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}